Subject: [PATCH] build: re-pin the g3imm header the alarm partition reads
 (1703)

Patch 1703 gives lib/include/nitro/gx/g3imm.h a uint32_t branch under
SDK_PORT_3DS. The header text without the macro is byte-identical (the
patch identity proof), but the file bytes changed, and
tools/alarm-partition/profile.json pins the raw SHA-256 in closure.
Re-record it so the DS gate can run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/alarm-partition/profile.json | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

